|YKOKeep spare coins in the bank. |YKBrembank|YKO or
|YKBrembank balance|YKO opens an account on first use and reports its
balance, liens, and spendable funds. Away from teleport-warded rooms:

  |YKBrembank deposit all|YKO
  |YKBrembank withdraw <amount>|YKO
  |YKBrembank lien|YKO
  |YKBrembank transfer <amount|all> from <registered alt>|YKO

Bank liens secure auction bids and some purchases. Player markets let sellers
set prices, while global item auctions handle valuable one-off goods. Read
|YKBhelp market|YKO and |YKBhelp auction|YKO before listing or bidding.

Darkwind has eleven professions. Herbalism, Mining, Skinning, Fishing, and
Forestry gather resources. Alchemy, Leatherworking, Smithing, Tailoring,
Cybernetics, and Carpentry turn materials into useful outputs. Refining is a
profession service.

The profession building is four east and one north of the Center of Town.
Buy the right tools there, then use |YKBprofessions guide|YKO for a practical
first route. Useful commands include:

  |YKBprofessions|YKO                  Review profession progress
  |YKBprofessions gathering|YKO        Review gathering
  |YKBprofessions crafting|YKO         Review crafting
  |YKBprofessions craftable|YKO        Find things you can make
  |YKBprofessions check <type> <target>|YKO
                                     Check a recipe's requirements
  |YKBreagents <type>|YKO              Review saved materials by type
  |YKBreagents search <item>|YKO       Find material source hints
  |YKBworkorders|YKO                   Review orders at the work-order board
  |YKBguildcraft list|YKO              Review guild-themed recipes

Professions reward patience. Gather, check what you have saved, compare recipe
requirements, and use the market to trade with other specialists.|000

